      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Headhunter agent — how it works\n\nThe ONE manual step is finding the people (recruiter searches LinkedIn/Bayt — no platform offers an API for that). Everything after is automatic:\n\n- **Add one** candidate via the single form, or **upload an Excel/CSV list** (columns: Name, Email, Phone, LinkedIn, Job Title, Client, Notes) to process dozens at once.\n- The agent scores fit, records them in the pipeline, and emails each a personalized interest message with a \"pick a time\" link. (WhatsApp is added once the Meta template is approved.)",
        "color": 5,
        "width": 2060,
        "height": 540
      }
    },
