      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Interest -> auto-book\n\nWhen the candidate clicks the interest link, the agent checks the real team calendar for the next 10 working days (Sun-Thu, 9:00-17:00 Riyadh) and books the first free 30-min slot automatically. If nothing is free, the recruiter is emailed to book manually and the candidate is told someone will follow up.",
        "color": 4,
